    "summary": "Bearer: an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN INFANTRY** model.\n\nOnce per turn, during [your opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after an enemy unit finishes shooting, you can pick an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** unit of yours up to 9\" from the bearer that at least one of those attacks hit. That unit can then [embark](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in a **TRANSPORT** of yours it is able to embark in, if it sits wholly within 6\" of that **TRANSPORT**.",
